      "extract": "\\numberwithin{equation}{subsection} \\subsection{Background: Rigid Dualizing Complexes} The concept of {\\em rigid dualizing complex} was introduced by M. Van den Bergh in his influential paper \\cite{VdB} from 1997. This was done for a noncommutative ring $A$ over a base field $\\K$. Let us recall the definition; but to simplify matters (and because here we are interested in the commutative situation), we shall state",
