      "extract": "\\label{sec:resolutions-modules} Let $A$ be a DG ring. We already mentioned that $\\cat{M}(A) = \\cat{DGMod} A$ is a DG category, equipped with a translation automorphism $\\opn{T}$. The homotopy category of $\\cat{DGMod} A$ is $\\til{\\cat{K}}(\\cat{DGMod} A)$, where by definition \\begin{equation} \\label{eqn:1016} \\opn{Hom}_{\\til{\\cat{K}}(\\cat{DGMod} A)}(M, N) := \\mrm{H}^0 \\bigl( \\opn{Hom}_A(M, N) \\bigr) . \\end{equation}",
